[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300400_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300400_01_0010","text":"制作人吃鲷鱼烧的时候\n是先吃头还是先吃尾巴～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300400_01_0020","text":"这个嘛……\n我好像从来没想过呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300400_01_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300400_01_0030","text":"雏菜是先吃哪边的？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300400_01_0040","text":"雏菜啊～，今天从肚子开始吃～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300400_01_0050","text":"……嗯～，好好吃～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300400_01_0060","text":"哈哈，吃得真香"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300400_01_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300400_01_0070","text":"啊哈～\n感觉好像有精神了～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300400_01_0080","text":"那就好\n……好了，快到练习时间了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300400_01_0090","text":"别迟到了哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300400_01_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300400_01_0100","text":"好～！"}]
